# Base image for every FROM in infrastructure/docker/Dockerfile (CONTRACT-DECISIONS item 20): the Docker Official Image
# python:3.14.10-slim-trixie (CPython 3.14.10 on Debian 13), by index digest. This repository stays on Python 3.14 and
# is moved by hand; the website and the AddOn moved on to python:3.15.2 (HCW-HybridCloudWorks#1468), so this pin is
# this repository's own and no longer shared. The tag beside the digest is documentation; Docker resolves the digest.
# scripts/check-versions.sh (ci.yml) fails when any FROM that is not an earlier stage differs from
# PYTHON_IMAGE@PYTHON_IMAGE_DIGEST. Plain shell assignments, read by /bin/sh.
# Resolved on 2026-11-07 from Docker Hub: python:3.14.10-slim-trixie and python:3.14-slim-trixie both pointed at this
# index digest (3.14.10 was the newest 3.14 patch; no 3.14.11 tag existed). Re-resolve with
# docker buildx imagetools inspect python:3.14.10-slim-trixie before the next move.
PYTHON_IMAGE=python:3.14.10-slim-trixie
PYTHON_IMAGE_DIGEST=sha256:af8a5aa14780025dbfbcfbc81bd8a91ebd87711dd5b0f48ed71090949dd7cb1d
PYTHON_VERSION=3.14.10
